<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="ffe684d5b-15c3-42b4-b184-bb7a97c7c5bd">Does not include intercompany financing of $4 and $441 for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f4e34ad3a-5942-4e33-95b7-ad7ec9fc8654">All other expenses primarily consist of:
Gearing-salaries and benefits and rent
Industrial Solutions-direct labor, salaries and benefits, and rent and utilities
Corporate-professional expenses</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f764bc7e0-1c13-4f64-a196-eeed86217a23">Restricted stock units granted and outstanding of 627,119 as of June 30, 2026 are excluded from the computation of diluted earnings due to the anti-dilutive effect as a result of the Company&#8217;s net loss for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026.  Restricted stock units granted and outstanding of 897,948 as of June 30, 2025 are excluded from the computation of diluted earnings due to the anti-dilutive effect as a result of the Company&#8217;s net loss for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f46d3c4e2-0e36-4594-bcf1-673a0fc96649">

Variable lease costs consist primarily of taxes, insurance, utilities, and common area or other maintenance costs for the Company&#8217;s leased facilities and equipment.</ix:footnote>
