   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;"><td style="width: 27pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">(<em style="font: inherit;">1</em>)</p> </td><td> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">Variable lease costs consist primarily of taxes, insurance, utilities, and common area or other maintenance costs for the Company&#8217;s leased facilities and equipment.</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#8203;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, future minimum lease payments under finance leases and operating leases were as follows:</p>
