  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: left;">Gearing segment orders nearly doubled&#160;versus the prior year period&#160;primarily due to higher&#160;demand from customers in all&#160;markets served, most notably in power generation which&#160;reflects significant orders from a leading OEM of natural gas turbines.&#160;Gearing revenues were up 32% relative to the&#160;prior year&#160;primarily due to&#160;increased&#160;shipments to power generation&#160;customers.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 36pt;">The Gearing segment&#8217;s&#160;operating loss decreased by&#160;$1,431&#160;from the prior year period. This&#160;decrease&#160;was primarily attributable to higher sales in the current&#160;year period, partially offset by the absence of a favorable $482 property tax adjustment recorded in the prior year period.</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
