     <td style="width: 63pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><b><a id="Item4_Mine" title="Item4_Mine" href="#"></a>Item 4.</b></p> </td>
     <td> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><b>Mine Safety Disclosures</b>&#160;</p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">Not Applicable.&#160;</p>
